    "text": "The well known compounds, $(+)-$ lactic acid and $(-)-$ lactic acid, have the same molecular formula, $\\mathrm{C}_{3} \\mathrm{H}_{6} \\mathrm{O}_{3}$. The correct relationship between them is",
