  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2012_che_a6.png\">\r\n\r\nBoth are optical isomers because they rotate the plane of polarised light in opposite directions.",
